[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0010","text":"嗯～～～？\n制作人，还在工作吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0020","text":"啊啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0030","text":"……抱歉，雏菜\n下一个工作，还没定下来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0040","text":"呐，制作人开心吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0050","text":"————什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0060","text":"开心～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0070","text":"…………是啊\n嗯，很开心哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0080","text":"这样啊～\n太好了呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0090","text":"哈哈，是啊\n……那种心情，很重要啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01230000_02_0100","text":"啊哈～\n雏菜也这么觉得～！"}]
